// **Gets almost nothing out of sleeping rough.**
//
// A bunk is 3 poles and one slot, and most towers put up one and stop.
// This person makes the second bunk a decision: without a bed they come
// back onto shift barely rested and work the whole day on the tired
// multiplier, which is visible in the cross-section as somebody moving
// slowly rather than as a warning.
//
// The mirror of `trait.nocturnal`, and they should be read together —
// one of them frees a bed and the other needs one.
TraitDef(
    id: "trait.light_sleeper",
    name: "Light sleeper",
    blurb: "no good at all on a hard deck",
    deck_rest_pct: 25,
)
